{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you lies the Deep Library, a seemingly endless library with books collected from unknown places.\u00a0 The rarest books on its shelves are very valuable to your collection, if you can bring them back to the library's atrium.\u00a0 However, the deeper you go, the more likely you are to encounter the strange and terrifying entities that maintain the library... entities that do not take kindly to visitors...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the original creator of &quot;Slender: The Eight Pages&quot; comes this first-person liminal horror roguelite, in which you must collect and escape with books from the library, which are added to your collection.\u00a0 As your collection grows, you gain resources to purchase upgrades for future runs, while also gaining the ability to venture deeper into the library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788390/extras/de502ac5597fc75db5def5ff50175a8c.avif?t=1774407327\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sprawling, procedurally-generated library; each Chamber retains the same layout for everyone, but how they connect each run is different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entities that roam the Chambers, looking for you; the deeper you go, the more entities you encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade system; use points gained while building your collection to add or increase abilities such as your stamina level, your flashlight battery life, and even your knowledge of the library.\u00a0 Points can be refunded and reapplied at will between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards for the most books retrieved, and the deepest library exploration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788390/extras/671dce5feb9a879844bd451b8c1c72c7.avif?t=1774407327\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(NOTE:</strong>\u00a0 Book titles and authors are procedurally generated; any resemblance to actual books or authors is purely coincidental.\u00a0 While steps have been taken to reduce the chance of generating 'inappropriate' or 'offensive' titles, their generation may still be possible; should such titles be generated, please understand that they are neither intentional nor malicious in nature.\u00a0 If any offensive or inappropriate titles are discovered, please report their Chamber number for review so they can be altered in a future update.\u00a0 Thanks!)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788390/2759ca602f2a4816264e7c8d3c11513eff4b2443.jpg"},{"name":"Wait, I thought it was 14?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788390/8d16c220d8f07dde63793780f5d188c6d1c2d080.jpg"},{"name":"Avert your eyes!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788390/ca76052195caadb6844df5d9347e0ab9ef15fac5.jpg"},{"name":"Average","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788390/48ab86b67612f31269c41effbaf77fe40d65cad8.jpg"},{"name":"Escaped","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788390/dfb3f223ae4a1f6e11ca934e8bb4b0a726f277e2.jpg"},{"name":"Not safe yet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788390/fbba1259dbc57534e081d0b57f7550cb7271bc35.jpg"},{"name":"Showing some spine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3788390/5a